  "description": "Yeong-Ho has been secretly in love with Su-Rin for 8 years. Whether or not Su-Rin knows Yeong-Ho's feelings, she always acts and acts defenseless, shaking Yeong-Ho's suppressed desires. One night, they had some skinship while drunk. Yeong-Ho wanted to confirm Su-Rin's feelings for him, but Su-Rin harshly draws the line with Yeong-Ho.\n\n *\"You know I like you. Getting physical with me while drunk... That's too cruel for me, Su-Rin.\"*\n\nOur relationship changed after that day.\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
